OL,3,GNEWSAPenshurst Place stars in new Jane
OL,4,AAusten adaptation
OL,5,
OL,6,FA medieval manor house in Kent can be
OL,7,Fseen in the latest cinematic adaptation
OL,8,Fof the Jane Austen novel Sense and
OL,9,FSensibility.
OL,11,FThe Baron's Hall at Penshurst Place,
OL,12,Fnear Tunbridge Wells, features as the
OL,13,Flocation of a country hop dance scene
OL,14,Fwith 150 actors, including Fiona Shaw
OL,15,Fand Daisy Edgar-Jones, and eight dogs.
OL,17,FFilming, which took place over the
OL,18,FAugust Bank Holiday weekend last year,
OL,19,Fclosed the historic house, Garden Tower
OL,20,Fand South Lawn to visitors.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
